  `rigidityFamilyPackage_of_concrete_tests`, and concrete Theorems `C`, `(R1)`--`(R3)`.
* `TipFront.GeneralGapLemmaG`: general-`δ` Lemma `G` (`lemmaG_general_delta`, `vlo:Gap`) for all
